    airo:evidenceText "This week, 1 facial recognition camera publicly shamed a famous business woman for jaywalking after its systems caught her face crossing an intersection." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "517" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/38f07e9d7d0a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "This week, 1 facial recognition camera publicly shamed a famous business woman for jaywalking after its systems caught her face crossing an intersection." ;
